              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho omusaadha yankoba ati: “Iwe omuntu, Musengwa Katonda akoba ati bino n'ebiragiro ebijiira ku alutaari: Bwe balimala okutaagho alutaari ey'ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa era ey'okumansiraku omusaayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakabona Abalevi ab'oku nda ya Zadoki, nga ni bonka abaseeta ye ndi okumpeereza, olibagha ente enume ng'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olitoola ku musaayi gwayo waagusiiga ku bintu bire ebiri ng'oti mayiga ga nsolo ebiri ku alutaari eyo, waagusiiga ni ku nsonda eina edh'omugo gwayo era ni ku mugo ogwo gwene okugwezunguluza. Mu nsambo eyo oliba ogitoireku okuba nga ti nongoofu, waagitukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olitwala ente eyo enume ey'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, baagyokera mu kifo eky'eisinzizo ekyateebwagho okwokerwangamu, kuliya okw'eisinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwiririra, olighaayo embuzi enume eziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, yaaba ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi. Olwo alutaari baliba bagitukwiza n'omusaayi gw'embuzi eyo, nga bwe baagitukuza n'ogw'ente enume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'olimala okutukuza alutaari olitoola mu byayo byo, ente enume eziraku kikyamu kyonakyona n'entaama enume nga yoona eziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waadhireeta mu maiso gange, nze Musengwa Katonda. Bakabona baadhimansiraku omuunhu, era baamala baadhookya dhaaba ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda ekyokebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olimala enaku musanvu nga buli lunaku otoola mu byayo byo, embuzi, n'ente enume, n'entaama enume, nga dhoonadhoona dhiziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, waadhitaagho dhibe ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabona balimala enaku musanvu nga bali kulongoosa alutaari okugitukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe balimala okukola batyo mu nnaku omusanvu edho, olwo okuviira irala ku lunaku olwomunaana n'okweyongerayo, bakabona baligheerangayo ku alutaari eyo ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebyokebwa, n'ebigheebwayo olw'okutabagana. Era nze ndibasiimanga imwe abantu bange. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
